OL,3,GNEWSASeaside resort's key route set for
OL,4,Anight closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeymouth Esplanade is set to close
OL,7,Fovernight over three weeks while the
OL,8,Froad is resurfaced.
OL,10,FDorset Council said the work on the key
OL,11,Fseafront route would be carried out in
OL,12,Fthree stages after checks found parts
OL,13,Fof the road surface were wearing out.
OL,15,FResidents with parking permits will be
OL,16,Fable to use them in the Swannery Car
OL,17,FPark. The works will not affect access
OL,18,Ffor pedestrians, and homes, businesses
OL,19,Fand hotels can still be reached on
OL,20,Ffoot.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
