OL,3,GNEWSASeaside resort's key route set for
OL,4,Anight closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is due to start on King's Street
OL,7,Fwith overnight closures in place on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday from 20:00 to 06:00
OL,9,FBST. Only the section of road being
OL,10,Fworked on at the time will be closed
OL,11,Fovernight, with signed diversion routes
OL,12,Fin place.
